rows.positive_text:
找出所有符合下列三個條件且定義在正整數上的非負整數值函數 $f$:
(1) 存在至少一個 $n$ ，有 $f(n) \neq 0$;
(2) 對於所有正整數 $x$ 和 $y$ ，有 $f(xy) = f(x) + f(y) $;
(3) 所有有 $f(k) = f(n-k) $ 的 $k < n$ 都有無限數量的正整數 $n$.

Determine all $f$ functions defined on the set of all positive integers and take non-negative integer values that satisfy the following three conditions:
(1) $f(n) \neq 0$ for at least one $n$;
(2) $f(xy) = f(x) + f(y) $ for each positive integer $x$ and $y$;
(3) there are infinitely many positive integers $n$ such as $f(k) = f(n-k) $ for all $k < n$.

